{"slug": "summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap", "title": "Summer Celebration at the Islands of Cocoplum Clubhouse: A Recap", "description": "On May 30th, friends & neighbors gathered for a sensational summer celebration at the Islands of Cocoplum Clubhouse. Hosted by FYI Yachts...", "date": "2024-06-17", "category": "Blog", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Summer-Celebration-at-the-Islands-of-Cocoplum-Clubhouse-A-Recap.png", "html": "<p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Summer-Celebration-at-the-Islands-of-Cocoplum-Clubhouse-A-Recap.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>On May 30th, friends and neighbors gathered for a sensational summer celebration at the Islands of Cocoplum Clubhouse. Hosted by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/fyiyachts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FYI Yachts</a> and Stroll Cocoplum, this event was a wonderful blend of community, fun, and connections.</p><p>The event showcased an impressive collaboration with various brands, featuring an array of summer wear from Remodel, Patou Soleil, and Malbon Golf. Our participating vendors included smart home automation experts Casa HiFi, the innovative Gentera Center for Precision Medicine, Craft Travel, The Bespoke Club, and Key Carts, your local go-to for golf carts.</p><p>The culinary offerings by Oberlin Catering were exceptional, with a delicious selection of passed bites perfectly complemented by a wonderful assortment of wines from Gerard Bertrand. Cocktails provided by Iceland’s very own Askur Gin and Helix 7 Vodka were a hit, along with the fantastic selection of craft beers from Magic 13 Brewery. Special thanks to In Motion Studio Design for the amazing graphic designs and signs that added a vibrant touch to our event.</p><p>This event was the perfect way to welcome summer, allowing us to get to know our amazing Cocoplum neighbors better, make new connections, and celebrate together as a community. We were thrilled by the fantastic turnout and grateful to everyone who helped make this event happen.</p><p>We can’t wait for our next gathering! <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/fyi-news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stay tuned</a> for more exciting events, and let’s continue to celebrate together as a vibrant community!</p><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap-7/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Summer-Celebration-at-the-Islands-of-Cocoplum-Clubhouse-A-Recap-7-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap-13-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Summer-Celebration-at-the-Islands-of-Cocoplum-Clubhouse-A-Recap-13-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap-8/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Summer-Celebration-at-the-Islands-of-Cocoplum-Clubhouse-A-Recap-8-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap-5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Summer-Celebration-at-the-Islands-of-Cocoplum-Clubhouse-A-Recap-5-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><br/><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/summer-celebration-at-the-islands-of-cocoplum-clubhouse-a-recap